      "welcomeLine": "You made it to Café Volan.",
      "subLine": "First postmark. The ocean is fifteen stops east."
    },
    "story": {
      "headline": "Hygge, on Bangs Avenue",
      "body": "Volan is busy and somehow never feels it. The room holds more people than it should and still leaves you space to sit with a cappuccino and not be hurried. Danish has a word for this. Asbury Park has Volan.",
      "insiderTip": "Get the bagel. Then stay longer than you meant to.",
      "parkingNote": "PLACEHOLDER"
    },
